@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "White-Glove Delivery & Installation Policy";
    var breadcrumbs = new List<(string Title, string Url)>
    {
        ("Shipping & Installation Policy", "")
    };
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <partial name="_Breadcrumb" model="breadcrumbs" />

    <div class="p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h1 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-4">White-Glove Delivery &amp; Installation Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-4">
            At Indoria, shipping heavy household appliances is treated as an engineering delivery operation rather than generic parcel distribution. Every shipment is handled by our trained personnel using dedicated air-suspension shockproof vehicles.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">1. Delivery Turnaround &amp; Time Slots</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary small mb-3">
            In primary metro clusters (Mumbai MMR, Bengaluru, Delhi NCR, Hyderabad, Chennai, Pune, Kolkata, Ahmedabad), orders placed before 3:00 PM are eligible for Next-Day Express Delivery. You will receive an SMS and WhatsApp notification with your delivery crew's assigned slot (Morning 9 AM - 1 PM or Afternoon 2 PM - 7 PM).
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">2. In-Home Placement &amp; Packaging Removal</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary small mb-3">
            Our delivery crew will navigate staircase or service elevator access and place the unit directly into your designated kitchen or utility space. The protective exterior crating and shrink film will be dismantled and cleared away responsibly for recycling.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">3. Free Certified Brand Installation</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary small mb-3">
            Installation is 100% complimentary on all large appliances (Refrigerators, Washing Machines, Air Conditioners, Televisions, and Dishwashers). Certified technicians execute leveling, water inlet/drainage hookups, electrical circuit checks, and provide a comprehensive operational briefing.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">4. Doorstep Transit Insurance</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary small mb-0">
            All merchandise is covered under Indoria Doorstep Transit Insurance until the sign-off inspection is executed. In the rare event of transit damage, a replacement unit is dispatched immediately with zero liability to the customer.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
